  "title": "Trouble Brewing at Tosche Station",
  "description": "With Boba Fett seeking additional recovery in the bacta tank, his flashbacks continue to occupy his mind. After a speeding train opened fire on the Tusken tribe, killing many, Boba convinced the chieftain to let him leave for the night in the search of a plan to stop the train. Fett approached Tosche Station. Inside, Fixer and Camie - two old friends of Luke Skywalker were among the patrons. Members of the Kintan Striders Gang freely took advantage of the customers, and when Fixer spoke up, one of the gang sought to set an example."
